ability, reinforcing our vote. Also we could compare with other candidates: B handles stress well (explicit), D responds adequately, A unknown. So maybe B has explicit stress resilience, but other concerns outweigh. So we can argue that while C lacks explicit stress resilience evidence, the inference from decision speed and reliability is sufficient, and combined with other strengths, C remains best.\n\nThus we will state we still recommend C, referencing the new inference and comparing to B's stress resilience but B's communication issues. Provide explicit facts: B handles stress very well, but makes nasty remarks, weak memory; D adequate but moody; A unknown. So C still best.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C."}
